{"id":"n63577-1-9","stage":4,"title":"성대 · 声带","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63577-1-9-1","ko":"목소리가 좀 쉰 것 같아요. 어디 아프세요?","zh":"您的声音听起来有点沙哑，是哪里不舒服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목소리가","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리가","audio":"/audio/74012d13a64ca3e5b621.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"쉰","meaning":"哑","explanation":"쉬다：哑；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65205","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉰","audio":"/audio/9d0fb633d6a531c804d5.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"아프세요?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프세요","audio":"/audio/2946510bbac50794cfd8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"哑","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"65205","definition":"嗓子出了毛病，声音变得粗哑，很难发出声音。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/713981b41f8ecc3fac79.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63577-1-9-2","ko":"노래를 많이 불렀더니 성대에 무리가 왔나 봐요.","zh":"因为唱了太多歌，看来声带负担过重了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노래를","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래를","audio":"/audio/e4d8b71da5f5c71ee421.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"불렀더니","meaning":"唱","explanation":"부르다：唱；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"4","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불렀더니","audio":"/audio/d19fee1fc35a66cf1f0c.mp3"}},{"text":"성대에","meaning":"声带","explanation":"성대：声带；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"성대","audio":"/audio/4e9a0ceaf841b4d2f290.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63577","senseId":"1","lemma":"성대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성대에","audio":"/audio/9122dc7208526ed0cd7d.mp3"}},{"text":"무리가","meaning":"超负荷，吃不消","explanation":"무리：超负荷，吃不消；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무리","audio":"/audio/a7e5e35fac23a9526184.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15326","senseId":"2","lemma":"무리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무리가","audio":"/audio/24b65090bd784965bf4c.mp3"}},{"text":"왔나","meaning":"产生，有","explanation":"오다：产生，有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"13","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔나","audio":"/audio/e928f4dfbdd4a6b1d413.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"唱","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"依照曲调歌唱。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"4e9a0ceaf841b4d2","term":"성대","zh":"声带","audio":"/audio/4e9a0ceaf841b4d2f290.mp3","entryId":"63577","definition":"喉咙中间褶皱形状的器官，通过呼气产生震动，从而发出声音。","pronunciation":["성대"]},{"id":"a7e5e35fac23a952","term":"무리","zh":"超负荷，吃不消","audio":"/audio/a7e5e35fac23a9526184.mp3","entryId":"15326","definition":"指过度做某事使健康状况变差。","pronunciation":["무리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"产生，有","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"出现有害健康的状态。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e4f45baca29d21a998b4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63577","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为唱了太多歌，看来声带负担过重了。","天气冷极了，河水都冻得结结实实的呢。","您的声音听起来有点沙哑，是哪里不舒服吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为唱了太多歌，看来声带负担过重了。","您的声音听起来有点沙哑，是哪里不舒服吗？","天气冷极了，河水都冻得结结实实的呢。"],"answer":0}]}
